38331>>>        Procedure OnRowClick String sRowId
38334>>>            tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38334>>>            tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38334>>>            Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
38335>>>
38335>>>            Case Begin
38335>>>                Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromParent)
38337>>>                    Send NavigateForward of oZoomLiga Self
38338>>>                    Case Break
38339>>>
38339>>>                Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromChild)
38342>>>                    Send NavigateClose Self
38343>>>                    Case Break
38344>>>
38344>>>                Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromMain)
38347>>>                    Send NavigateClose Self
38348>>>                    Case Break
38349>>>
38349>>>                Case Else 
38349>>>                    Send NavigateForward of oZoomLiga Self
38350>>>            Case End
38350>>>        End_Procedure
